- @root: Back

@data
title: Election data

= Election data

General elections 2015–2023: official results of the Spanish Ministry of the Interior (infoelectoral), compiled in the MiCongreso project by josemam: https://github.com/josemam/MiCongreso

Regional elections 2011–2023: official results compiled in the histEleccionesAutonomicas project by rricote: https://github.com/rricote/histEleccionesAutonomicas

Electoral law: Spanish Constitution (arts. 68, 99, 113, 115) and the Ley Orgánica del Régimen Electoral General (arts. 162–163), plus each autonomous community's electoral law.

- @credits: Back

